      "y": 546,
      "width": 325,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "\u274c Bad (failure_workshop_agent)\n\u2022 [V002/S003] Broken callback returns raw dict\n\u2022 Branch 0: Leaks .85 balance + SSN \"9921\"\n\u2022 Zero after_tool_callback (uninspected egress)\n\u2022 Probabilistic model bypasses security checks",
